            "label": {
              "en": "approximation",
              "ar": null
            },
            "colorClass": "amber",
            "value": "degree 3"
          }
        ],
        "note": {
          "en": "\\(N\\) nonzero terms match \\(\\sin x\\) through degree \\(2N-1\\). Far from \\(0\\) the polynomial eventually peels away.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Geometric series",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty ar^n=\\frac{a}{1-r},\\;|r|&lt;1 \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "p-series test",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\sum\\frac{1}{n^p} \\) converges iff \\( p&gt;1 \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Ratio test",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( L=\\lim\\left|\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}\\right| \\); converges if \\( L&lt;1 \\), diverges if \\( L&gt;1 \\)",
              "ar": null
            },
            "wide": true
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Alternating series",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "Converges if \\( b_n\\searrow 0 \\) monotonically",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 10.A — Infinite geometric series",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Evaluate \\( \\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\Big(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\Big)^{n} \\).</p><p>Here \\( a=1,\\ r=\\tfrac12 \\), and \\( |r|&lt;1 \\), so the series converges:</p>\\[ \\frac{a}{1-r}=\\frac{1}{1-\\tfrac12}=2. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 10.B — Maclaurin approximation",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Approximate \\( e^{0.1} \\) with a third-degree Taylor polynomial.</p><p>Using \\( e^{x}\\approx 1+x+\\tfrac{x^2}{2}+\\tfrac{x^3}{6} \\) at \\( x=0.1 \\):</p>\\[ 1+0.1+0.005+0.000167\\approx 1.1052. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
